# Repo layout

- `frontend/` — new **Next.js** app. All new UI goes here.
- `frontend-legacy/` — frozen old CRA (`legacy-frontend-freeze`). Read only.
- `backend/` — existing API. Do not rip it out for UI work.
- `docs/` — product, brand, copy for agents.
- `AGENTS.md` — start here.

Do not restore AWS markdown, `src_legacy_archive`, or the discarded landing rewrite.
Do not add a fifth brand color to “fix” contrast. Use the four hexes in `docs/BRAND.md`.
